                                "sense_id": "352d1d13-515b-3816-9569-d2f371f10e52",
                                "text": "[A]ll which things, bring perill to thoſe that know not how to uſe them well; and neither honour and credit, nor puiſſance, but rather argue their feebleneſse and impuiſſance."
